WEBVTT

00:00:58.617 --> 00:01:01.726
I was leaving a seminar when it started,

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.887
humming to myself, fumbling with my bag

00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:06.310
just as I'd done a hundred times before,

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:08.786
when suddenly I heard
a voice calmly observe,

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.978
"She is leaving the room."

00:01:11.002 --> 00:01:12.393
I looked around, and there
was no one there,

00:01:12.417 --> 00:01:15.067
but the clarity
and decisiveness of the comment

00:01:15.091 --> 00:01:16.911
was unmistakable.

00:01:16.935 --> 00:01:19.555
Shaken, I left my books
on the stairs and hurried home,

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.794
and there it was again.

00:01:20.818 --> 00:01:22.857
"She is opening the door."

00:01:22.881 --> 00:01:26.829
This was the beginning.
The voice had arrived.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.076
And the voice persisted,

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.541
days and then weeks of it, on and on,